  "description": "The minimum dominating set track of FrontierCO (Feng et al., 2025), 60 undirected graphs in the PACE 2025 graph format (`p ds n m`, then one edge per line): 20 easy test instances named after the exact track of the PACE 2025 dominating set challenge, 20 hard test instances named after its heuristic track, and 20 generated Barabasi-Albert validation graphs. Each instance is a graph whose nodes are 1 to n, isolated ones included; FrontierCO's reference value for each instance is in the track's config.py.",
  "domain": "Minimum dominating set",
