  "recipe": {
    "reason": "Its 20 hard test instances hold 164,677,007 edges between them by their problem lines (the largest 12,885,369), and a collection is held whole: the easy and validation instances alone hold 10,239,865 edges, read and checked with the dimacs-graph parser in its pace layout, which is the recipe this entry would use. It becomes fetchable when graph/v1 results can be streamed (https://github.com/Mearman/keepset/issues/305).",
    "status": "not-fetchable"
